# Normal installations write BOOT to /EFI/InfiltratorOS/BOOT and register
# its firmware entry. They must never overwrite EFI/BOOT, Microsoft or GRUB.
# The historical install revision history is retained in Git commits,
# not duplicated as obsolete comments in this executable.
